  - Nvidia’s market value crossed $4 trillion on July 9, 2025, driven primarily by strong demand for its Blackwell accelerator rack systems (GB200/GB300) and the broader AI-capex supercycle [Source: ev-1].
  - This milestone was further propelled by the Stargate project's approximately $500 billion plan for AI infrastructure and repeatedly raised capital expenditure guidance from major hyperscalers including Microsoft, Meta, Google, and Amazon throughout 2025 [Source: ev-1].
