  - CEO Jensen Huang framed this moment as a transition from training to inference demand, describing "AI factories" selling compute as a commodity [Source: ev-1].
  - This valuation reflects a rapid trajectory where Nvidia reached $1 trillion mid-2023, $2 trillion in February 2024, and $3 trillion in June 2024 before hitting the $4 trillion mark in July 2025 [Source: ev-1].
